 T1 au T3 \n\nÀ partir de 71 000€ TTC hors mobilier\n\nJusqu'à 4,15% avant avantage fiscal\n\nActabilité : T3 2026 — Livraison : T2 2027","addr":"3 Rue du Port des Fosses","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTU2MGMxMWI2MDQyNi42NzQ0MTY3OCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6ImEyMDk4N2UyYjBmODIyMmQwZDMwOTJmNGJlZTE0MGQ0Mjg2MzZmMGRkZmM1NDY0MGE2ZmQ5MzBhOWU3ZDJjYWQifQ==?signature=58034ca8bea0d19c678c5d6d2c79379269a8ba6482fe96306ff6ead91f79ab97","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTU2MGMxNTU3MjllNS4yMTI5NjkyNCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjU4ZjcxYmExODUwMDk3ZDZhMDFkMWU2NmY1MWYzYWE5YTM3YTNkMWIwMzhlZmMyMGUwMTlhYmUyZTQ3OWRkMTgifQ==?signature=34a4dc3e961161b2669ea16bbcd9b73d20576e312cf45f5613ccbe1671399d3b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTU2MGMxYThiMTgwMS4yMjQ0NzAzNSIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6Ijc2YjJkY2NmZTk5ZGQ5ODYxMjI4ZDY1NGI4Zjk2ZTcyYTVmMDk5OWFmMDFjYmZjODBiOTE3MDk2MjRiYTQ3ZGMifQ==?signature=39869e227217f82c06ffa06c1fc72d34bc2c66c9b0fe1e56368b55d2e9f8a703","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182YTU2MGMxYThjNTBlMS4yMzU4NjE0MSIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjhhZWQwZTA4Y2M4ZWY0ZDgwNWJhYWEyOWNkYWIzNTIwOWNjMjcxODczZDJiYWRlNzEzZWIwMmNhZTdhODJjOWQifQ==?signature=34588c88fc1544f271871b8f1871466a23bf5ecc7fd577770e35b573e20b47e0"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OWE1NmRkZTcxZDQyNS40NDg3MDQ5NSIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ